+# CONTRACT — Permission Maze Document Management API
+
+`createApp()` exported from `src/app.ts` returns an Express app. In-memory storage. TS.
+
+## Auth
+- [ ] POST /auth/register {username,password} → 201 {id,username} → test
+- [ ] register missing username/password → 400 → test
+- [ ] register duplicate username → 409 → test
+- [ ] POST /auth/login {username,password} valid → 200 {token} → test
+- [ ] login wrong password / unknown user → 401 → test
+- [ ] protected route w/o token → 401 → test
+- [ ] protected route w/ malformed/invalid token → 401 → test
+
+## Folders
+- [ ] POST /folders {name} → 201 folder, creator is owner → test
+- [ ] POST /folders {name,parentId} nested, parent exists & editor+ → 201 → test
+- [ ] POST /folders parentId not found → 404 → test
+- [ ] POST /folders parentId no access → 403 → test
+- [ ] POST /folders missing name → 400 → test
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id as owner/viewer → 200 → test
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id no access → 403 → test
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id not found → 404 → test
+- [ ] PATCH /folders/:id editor+ → 200 updated → test
+- [ ] PATCH /folders/:id viewer only → 403 → test
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id owner → 204, cascades subfolders+documents → test
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id non-owner (editor) → 403 → test
+
+## Documents
+- [ ] POST /documents {title,content,folderId} editor+ on folder → 201, creator owner → test
+- [ ] POST /folders/:folderId/documents → 201 → test
+- [ ] POST /documents folder not found → 404 → test
+- [ ] POST /documents no access to folder → 403 → test
+- [ ] POST /documents missing title/folderId → 400 → test
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id viewer+ → 200 → test
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id no access → 403 → test
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id not found → 404 → test
+- [ ] PATCH /documents/:id editor+ → 200, updatedAt changes → test
+- [ ] PATCH /documents/:id viewer → 403 → test
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id owner → 204 → test
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id editor (not owner) → 403 → test
+
+## Sharing & Permissions
+- [ ] POST /share share document w/ user as viewer → 201, target can GET → test
+- [ ] shared viewer cannot PATCH → 403 → test
+- [ ] shared editor can PATCH and can share → test
+- [ ] share folder → grants inherited access to docs inside (read) → test
+- [ ] editor cannot grant owner role → 403 → test
+- [ ] owner can grant owner role → test
+- [ ] share by non-editor → 403 → test
+- [ ] share to unknown user → 404 → test
+- [ ] share invalid role → 400 → test
+- [ ] MOST PERMISSIVE: direct viewer + folder editor → effective editor (can PATCH) → test
+- [ ] inheritance through nested folder ancestors → test
+
+## Activity Log
+- [ ] GET /activity → 200 array → test
+- [ ] doc create/update/delete logged with action,userId,resourceId,timestamp → test
+- [ ] share event logged → test
+
+## Validation
+- [ ] npm run build clean
+- [ ] npm run lint clean
+- [ ] npm test all pass
